{"annotations": [], "charCount": 60, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 37, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0010_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "孔子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "鄭", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "衛", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "韓", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "莊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "夷貉", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_010_0010_0010", "locator": "揚子法言 › 『揚子法言』 修身 卷第三 › 或問：｢人有倚孔子之牆, 弦鄭·衛之聲, 誦韓·莊之書,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_010_0010_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_010", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 或問：｢人有倚孔子之牆, 弦鄭·衛之聲, 誦韓·莊之書, 則引諸門乎?｣. 曰：｢在夷貉則引之, 倚門牆則麾之.｣.", "title": "或問：｢人有倚孔子之牆, 弦鄭·衛之聲, 誦韓·莊之書,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 24, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "萬物由之以通.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 37, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "言道旣可以通中國, 而適夷狄, 學亦可以統正典, 而兼諸子也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 39, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 20, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0020_0010", "indexTerms": [], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_010_0020_0010", "locator": "揚子法言 › 『揚子法言』 問道 卷第四 › 或問道, 曰：｢道也者, 通也, 無不通也.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_010_0020_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_010", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 或問道, 曰：｢道也者, 通也, 無不通也.｣. 或曰：｢可以適它與.｣.", "title": "或問道, 曰：｢道也者, 通也, 無不通也.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 17, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "礙, 限.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 49, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 36, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0020_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "貉", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_010_0020_0020", "locator": "揚子法言 › 『揚子法言』 問道 卷第四 › 聖人之治天下也, 礙諸以禮樂, 礙, 限. 無則禽,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_010_0020_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_010", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 聖人之治天下也, 礙諸以禮樂, 無則禽, 異則貉, 吾見諸子之小禮樂也, 不見聖人之小禮樂也.", "title": "聖人之治天下也, 礙諸以禮樂, 礙, 限. 無則禽,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 85, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 50, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0030_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "皐陶", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "洪範", "type": "서명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_010_0030_0010", "locator": "揚子法言 › 『揚子法言』 問明 卷第六 › 或問：｢人何尙?｣. 曰：｢尙智.｣.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_010_0030_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_010", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 或問：｢人何尙?｣. 曰：｢尙智.｣. 曰：｢多以智殺身者, 何其尙?｣. 曰：｢昔乎, 皐陶以其智爲帝謨, 殺身者遠矣. 箕子以其智爲武王陳洪範, 殺身者遠矣.｣.", "title": "或問：｢人何尙?｣. 曰：｢尙智.｣.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 12, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "什一稅民, 天下之中賦正法也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 22, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "『公羊傳』曰：多乎十一, 大桀·小桀, 寡乎十一, 大貉·小貉.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 22, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 13, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0040_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "桀", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "貉", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "公羊傳", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "大桀", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "小桀", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "大貉", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "小貉", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_010_0040_0010", "locator": "揚子法言 › 『揚子法言』 先知 卷第九 › 什一, 天下之正也.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_010_0040_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_010", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 什一, 天下之正也. 多則桀, 寡則貉.", "title": "什一, 天下之正也.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 35, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "昔之隱者, 文王拘於羑里而重易六爻, 箕子隱於殷朝而爲周陳洪範, 接輿之在楚而歌鳳兮.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 161, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 102, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0050_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "文王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "羑里", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "殷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "周", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "洪範", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "接輿", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楚", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "接輿", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "洪範", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "接輿", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_010_0050_0010", "locator": "揚子法言 › 『揚子法言』 淵騫 卷第十一 › 或曰：｢隱者也?｣. 曰：｢昔之隱者, 吾聞其語矣, 又聞其行矣.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_010_0050_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_010", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 或曰：｢隱者也?｣. 曰：｢昔之隱者, 吾聞其語矣, 又聞其行矣.｣. 或曰：｢隱道多端?｣. 曰：｢固也. 聖言聖行, 不逢其時, 聖人隱也. 賢言賢行, 不逢其時, 賢者隱也. 談言談行, 不逢其時, 談者隱也. 昔者, 箕子之漆其身也, 狂接輿之被其髮也, 欲去而恐罹害者也, 箕子之洪範, 接輿之歌鳳也哉.｣.", "title": "或曰：｢隱者也?｣. 曰：｢昔之隱者, 吾聞其語矣, 又聞其行矣.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 62, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 39, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_010_ko_010_0060_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "仲尼", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "夷貉", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "沱", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "漢", "type": "지명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_010_0060_0010", "locator": "揚子法言 › 『揚子法言』 君子 卷第十二 › 曰：｢仲尼之道, 猶四瀆也, 經營中國, 終入大海.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_010_0060_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_010", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 曰：｢仲尼之道, 猶四瀆也, 經營中國, 終入大海. 它人之道者, 西北之流也, 綱紀夷貉, 或入於沱, 或淪於漢.｣.", "title": "曰：｢仲尼之道, 猶四瀆也, 經營中國, 終入大海.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
